  <description>
    <p>
      Redumper GUI provides a graphical interface for redumper,
      a command-line tool for dumping optical discs.
    </p>
    <p>
      This appimage includes the redumper version selected by the
      upstream developer for this release.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is an unofficial AppImage package maintained by zany130.
      Packaging issues should be reported to the Flatpak repository.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.deterous.redumper-gui.desktop</launchable>

